            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "01 Mar 2023 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "I was invited by Hal McGee to curate an Electronic Cottage group project, so I came up with an idea to put together a compilation in which the members would contribute a 2 minute noise track and send it in AFTER the deadline of Feb. 28, 2023.\nThe tracks at the bottom of the compilation are the ones that came in first, (in some cases, BEFORE the deadline). The most slack submissions are the ones you'll see at the top. The list will be updated as more tracks come in.\nCheck back often (or whenever you might get around to it)!\nP.S. - The individual track pages (most of them) have their own artwork and links. Check those too (if you remember). Thanks to all present and future EC contributors!",
            "credits": "released March 1, 2023",
            "license": "Attribution Non-commercial Share Alike",
