                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1492035642_0",
                    "art_id": 1492035642,
                    "about": "At first I did not notice the fact that the track could only be 2 minutes so I had made a much longer track. So then when I saw this fact I remixed and cut down to 2 minutes.\nI still have the original longer version that I may release as a stand alone sometime in the future. For now the remix version will be presented for this project.\nMy band camp link:  aspect.bandcamp.com\nThanks, Mike Cosma",
                    "credits": "from PROCRASTINOISE - an Electronic Cottage compilation, released March 1, 2023",
