                    "about": "Hal McGee currently resides in the E.C.S.R. (Electronic Cottage Soviet Republic).\nhalmcgee.bandcamp.com",
                    "credits": "from PROCRASTINOISE - an Electronic Cottage compilation, released March 1, 2023",
                    "license": "Attribution Non-commercial Share Alike"
                },
                {
                    "title": "Hard Noise Mouth Foley",
                    "duration": "01:59",
                    "lyrics": null,
                    "label": null,
                    "track_id": 3286960699,
                    "track_num": "52",
                    "artist": "Maggie Wynn Kingsford",
                    "url": "https://aversiontoreality.bandcamp.com/track/hard-noise-mouth-foley",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1062871457_0",
                    "art_id": 1062871457,
                    "about": "My explanation of why it took so long...\nMan i over thought this to many times, then i could not find white cables to hook my pedals..i was going for a certain art aesthetic..oh snap!! I have to go back to $1.25 store to purchase a few more quality batteries...hmmm what shoes to wear...i will get it done...i have a couple more hours.. Let me go get some coffee...then i can knock it right out and upload it....i got time...lol",
                    "credits": "from PROCRASTINOISE - an Electronic Cottage compilation, released March 1, 2023",
                    "license": "Attribution Non-commercial Share Alike"
                },
