            "about": "Apartment Music 16 was held Saturday, September 15, 2012 at Hal McGee's apartment in Gainesville, Florida.\nRecorded on a Panasonic RR930 microcassette desktop recorder.\nThe performance of Mark McGee and Christopher Nadeau is presented here in short excerpted form because the tape on which their performance was recorded broke!\nIn 2025 Trevor Luke found this video of Trotsky and Hal McGee at AM16 on a camera that he hadn't used in several years —  youtu.be/vX0ozG7h0kc\nClick on each track name to go to a separate page for each performance, each with a photo and credits.\nFront cover photo by Kathy Burkett — Gracie the Noise Dachshund answering Bulky Acronym's circuit bent telephone.\nCanned Ham and Trotsky & Hal McGee track photos by Kathy Burkett.",
            "credits": "released September 18, 2012\nApartment Music produced and recorded by Hal McGee",
            "license": "all rights reserved",
            "coverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a2471635094_0",
