            "datePublished": "30 Sep 2013 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "Apartment Music #19, Saturday, September 14, 2013, Hal and Mark McGee's apartment, Gainesville, Florida, USA. Apartment Music is a long-running series of shows curated by Hal McGee featuring improvisation, experimental and noise music.\nPerformances by: Mark McGee, Aggressive Investment, Aaron Abrams, Fiver's Stereo, Ragdoll Poet, Heirloom, John David Eriksen, Trotsky's Watercooler, A.J. Herring, James Bess, and Hal McGee.\nI have created a video playlist on YouTube of all of the performances at Apartment Music #19:\nwww.youtube.com/watch?v=ZKbLAMBP4A8&list=PL6iCLTPhajwY6QMYy4zqpnKk_eoF09AIR",
            "credits": "released September 30, 2013\ncover photo by Andrew Chadwick",
