            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "01 Nov 2014 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "HalTapes presents\nApartment Music 27\nSaturday, September 13, 2014\n1. Ricardo D'Orlando\n2. Bluesharp\n3. Andrew Chadwick\n4. Hell Garbage\n5. Rauh\n6. Lumen Kishkumen\n7. A.J. Herring\n8. Captain Mission\nsound and caffeine technology by Lenny Pearlman\nskull provided by Mark McGee\nApartment Music is a long-running series of concerts of experimental, improvisation, electronic and noise music at Hal McGee's apartment in Gainesville, Florida.\nApartment Music 27 was originally issued on cassette on the Kassette Kult Tapes label, K7KT 006, Summer 2014.",
            "credits": "released November 1, 2014",
            "license": "all rights reserved",
