            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "06 Apr 2018 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "Apartment Music 28\nSaturday, March 24, 2018\n​\n​Performers were:\nA.J. Herring, Tom Miller, John David Eriksen, Ironing, RumTumTum, Hal McGee, Fiver's Stereo, Dylan Houser, Joe Billingsley, Penny Grune-Fae.\nOur special guests were Jen Sandwich and Rosemarie Romero.\nApartment Music is a long running series of concerts\nhosted by Hal McGee in his apartment in Gainesville, Florida\n​featuring performances of experimental and electronic music, improvisation, and noise\nThe performances at Apartment Music 28\n​were recorded direct to cassette\nby Hal McGee",
            "credits": "released April 6, 2018",
            "license": "all rights reserved",
