            "about": "Apartment Music 33\nSunday, January 13, 2019\nwith special guest Girls On Fire\nview a page at Electronic Cottage featuring extensive photographic and video documentation of Apartment Music 33:\nwww.electroniccottage.org/hal-mcgee/apartment-music-33\nApartment Music is a long-running series of concerts and sessions of experimental and electronic music, improvisation and noise in Hal McGee's apartment in Gainesville, Florida.",
