            "about": "SIDE A\nRON ANDERSON\n- City Of Churches (5:40)\nwith Ken Claire - alto sax and Kathy Life - vocals\nIf, BWANA\n- Bwana In Brooklyn (Sunday afternoon) (8:16)\n- YRRAB (3:27)\n- LIEN (2:53)\nTHICK SLIMY WHISPER\n- Trance And Dance (9:10)\nCheryl Sobas, Paul Richards, Al Margolis\nrecorded live\nSide B\nNOMUZIC\n- Howard Beach Boogie (Beri'ah: The Neck & Shoulders) (6:25)\nCarl Howard - bass sequencer\nAmaury Prez - drums\nLarry Olsen - guitar\nDoug Walker - synthesizer\nCROINERS\n- Assembly 1 (5:28)\n- Assembly 2 (3:28)\nALIEN PLANETSCAPES\n- Ground Zero Brooklyn (13:05)\nrecorded live at Space Station Studio\nCAUSE AND EFFECT COMPILATION 004\nSUBURBAN NIGHTMARE\nProduced by Hal McGee and Debbie Jaffe in 1986\nFront cover image adapted from \"Brooklyn Bridge\" by George Grosz",
