                    "artist": "Hal McGee",
                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/here-comes-picassos-ghost-in-gainesville",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3689347234_0",
                    "art_id": 3689347234,
                    "about": "This is an authorized cover version of a song by Girls On Fire titled \"Here Comes Picasso's Ghost\", which was originally issued on the IN MY BLOOD album (1985). You can listen to the original song here -  cassetteartclassics.bandcamp.com/track/picasso-s-ghost\nI modified Leslie Singer's original song lyrics to fit with the theme of encountering Picasso in my city of Gainesville, Florida.",
