                    "about": "krseward.bandcamp.com\nMade using VCV Rack, grout brush actuation, Grainstorm, Bento, Pink Trombone, etc.\nDone for EC Chance Encounters In The City compilation. [This is later, trimmed version for submission.]\n[Title note: Meant to be a fragment of what character Dr. Simon Van Gelder says to Mr. Spock to exhort him to try mind meld with him. Implicit new context here is aforementioned Chance Encounters In The City. What is exchanged on the street, on the fly.]",
