                {
                    "title": "Not Broken - Bended IV",
                    "duration": "04:57",
                    "lyrics": null,
                    "label": null,
                    "track_id": 3637009677,
                    "track_num": "27",
                    "artist": "Peter Heß (Germany)",
                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/not-broken-bended-iv",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1907501536_0",
                    "art_id": 1907501536,
                    "about": "Used instruments:\n- Yamaha PSS-270 (Dataline bends) Main instrument used to create the \"Swing Pattern\"\nBrocken Yamaha PSS-790 (Keyboard was destroyed by the children of the previous owner. So I removed the Keyboard and rehoused the controlling section. Bended with the faboulous \"Snail Patchbay) and played with a Doepfer Ribbon Controller (a fretless controller which creates MIDI) The nasty \"Bassoon sound\"\n- Bended Yamaha DD-50 Drumset (Bended by Meister Baum)\n- PSS-7 Added one glitch to get also credits in this post\nMultitrack Recording\nPostprocessing:\nMaster: Limiter, Delay&Reverb\nDD-50 Track Compressor\nRecorded \"live\" in 4 tracks. First track was the PSS-270\nRecorded in Rinderbügen a small cowtown in Germany, not far away from Kaulstoß (The magical town of krautrock history)",
                    "credits": "from Cheap and Plastic, released August 17, 2012",
                    "license": "Attribution Share Alike"
                },
