            "datePublished": "10 Mar 2021 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "Hal McGee presents the\nCHEAP AND PLASTIC #2 compilation\nfeaturing the sounds of cheap and plastic consumer level Casio, Yamaha, Bontempi, Kawasaki, Concertmate, and other various brand electric-powered keyboards! -- also known as tablehooters or kiddie keyboards!\nClick on each track name to view individual artwork panels for each track.\nco-produced by Chris Phinney, who chose the order of the tracks\nCheap And Plastic #1 was issued on Bandcamp in 2012\nhalmcgee.bandcamp.com/album/cheap-and-plastic\noriginal Cheap And Plastic album artwork by W.A. Davison\nThanks to Chris Holland (Igor Amokian) for assistance with the compilation project.",
