                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/swow",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3871079633_0",
                    "art_id": 3871079633,
                    "about": "My trusty CASIO SA-1. I remember the moment in 1990 I bought it at a shop that I NEVER went to before and after - saw it in the shop window and the description and price were just too convincing. I never regretted that I bought it!\nI used it in numerous cassette productions.\nExcept for vocals and a nature sample, I only used completely unaltered sounds from the keyboard in *Swow*.\nAfter years on the attic, I use the keyboard quite regularly again, since I produced *Swow*.\nwww.LordLitter.de",
                    "credits": "from Cheap And Plastic #2, released March 10, 2021",
                    "license": "all rights reserved"
                },
