                    "artist": "Lob Instagon (USA)",
                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/the-dream",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a2966929912_0",
                    "art_id": 2966929912,
                    "about": "In general I play bass and do collaborative improv exclusively. as INSTAGON. .I very rarely play solo. BUT, I do read poetry regularly..and its something i DO do solo. I have a series of poems called \"dream\" poems.. and so for this track i have spliced the opening lines from a number of these poems together into one piece...thinking that it would probably be a different sort of submission in this collection for sure. For collab work on this project.. i COULD do more spoken material.. or i could do some bass or some drones...it would be up to the collaborator.. i suppose..",
                    "credits": "from Contact Compilation 1, released October 22, 2011\nLob (Instagon)\nSacramento, CA, USA\ninstagon@gmail.com\nwww.tif.org\nwww.instagon.com\nwww.norcalnoisefest.com\nwww.ain23.com\nInstagon @ bandcamp, myspace, facebook, reverbnation, ect..\nConceptual artist, bassist, chaos enthusiast, noise, improv, poetry, art, & more.\nalso the booking ogre for Norcal Noisefest",
                    "license": "Attribution Non-commercial No Derivatives"
