                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3015427877_0",
                    "art_id": 3015427877,
                    "about": "I RECORDED WITH: PEAVEY \"ENVOY 110\" COMBO AMP, DIGITECH MULTI-EFFECTS PROCESSOR, CASIO \"TONE BANK\" CT-670, AND ZOOM MSR-8 RECORDER. THIS SONG/TRACK IS TWO LAYERED TRACKS OF UNPLANNED FIRST TAKE IMPROVISATION. THE RECORDING TECHNIQUE I USED IS WITH A BUILT IN CONDENSOR MICROPHONE ON THE MSR-8, IT CAPTURED THE SOUND COMING OUT OF THE KEYBOARD BEFORE IT WAS PROCESSED THROUGH THE EFFECTS PROCESSOR AND COMBO AMP AND THE EFFECTS PROCESSOR/COMBO AMP SOUND.",
                    "credits": "from Contact Compilation 1, track released October 19, 2011\nJared C. Balogh (Trans Atlantic Rage/Balogh/Altered State Reflections)\nBethlehem, PA 18015\nalteredstatereflections@hotmail.com  also  shadowentitywizard.blogspot.com\nMulti-Media Artist (Music/Art/Video)/ Multi-Genre Artist (Jazz, Classical, noise, glitch, etc.)/ Experimental/ Avant-Garde/ Altered State Reflections/ studio, field and live sound engineer/recording/production/mastering/editing",
