                    "about": "Serious Lips was recorded with an Access Virus TI and a Korg microKORG. I wanted to create a \"wall of sound\" with this piece, but without the typical power noise that is far too easy to do with so much multilayering. Perhaps I succeeded, perhaps I did not. The important thing is I had fun trying!",
