                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3721605106_0",
                    "art_id": 3721605106,
                    "about": "This is a little something thrown together with a sample of a boom box recording of me playing a Wiggles toy accordion over shortwave static. I was going to put some nice, moody guitar as well but i didn't much care for it so all I ended up using from that source material was my cough just before I hit stop on the player.",
