                {
                    "title": "I Am Awake But My Dreamscape Is Still On",
                    "duration": "01:00",
                    "lyrics": null,
                    "label": null,
                    "track_id": 15619462,
                    "track_num": "12",
                    "artist": "Jared C. Balogh (USA)",
                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/i-am-awake-but-my-dreamscape-is-still-on",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3819250742_0",
                    "art_id": 3819250742,
                    "about": "I RECORDED WITH: PEAVEY \"ENVOY 110\" COMBO AMP, DIGITECH MULTI-EFFECTS PROCESSOR, CASIO \"TONE BANK\" CT-670, AND ZOOM MSR-8 RECORDER. THIS SONG IS TWO SEPARATE TRACKS PLAYING AT THE SAME TIME (ONE TAKE LEFT CHANNEL OTHER TAKE RIGHT CHANNEL) OF UNPLANNED FIRST TAKE IMPROVISATION. THE RECORDING TECHNIQUE I USED IS WITH A BUILT IN CONDENSOR MICROPHONE ON THE MSR-8, IT CAPTURED THE SOUND COMING OUT OF THE KEYBOARD BEFORE IT WAS PROCESSED THROUGH THE EFFECTS PROCESSOR AND COMBO AMP AND THE EFFECTS PROCESSOR/COMBO AMP SOUND.",
                    "credits": "from Contact Compilation 2, track released October 24, 2011\nJared C. Balogh (Trans Atlantic Rage/Balogh/Altered State Reflections)\nBethlehem, PA 18015\nalteredstatereflections@hotmail.com  also  shadowentitywizard.blogspot.com\nMulti-Media Artist (Music/Art/Video)/ Multi-Genre Artist (Jazz, Classical, noise, glitch, etc.)/ Experimental/ Avant-Garde/ Altered State Reflections/ studio, field and live sound engineer/recording/production/mastering/editing",
