                {
                    "title": "he changed the photo on his facebook page to reflect his mood",
                    "duration": "00:59",
                    "lyrics": null,
                    "label": null,
                    "track_id": 3770910930,
                    "track_num": "23",
                    "artist": "frankie death (Australia)",
                    "url": "https://halmcgee.bandcamp.com/track/he-changed-the-photo-on-his-facebook-page-to-reflect-his-mood",
                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a3251528253_0",
                    "art_id": 3251528253,
                    "about": "'this track was created around field recordings i made in south east asia - a festival in Myanmar and chanting inside a sound temple in thailand - then i added a live drum loop, played acoustic guitar, added synth and sang some meaningful lyrics (which just happened to come to mind) - the result was a night of remembering how at times while travelling i've relied on the technological advances that allow us to connect, communicate and make contact. the way we use the internet is limitless. how we chose to use the tools - this track was created, as usually, in a spontaneous and improvised manner on the night of 24th of October, 2011. Hobart, Tasmania, Australia.'\ncosmiccoffinmusic@gmail.com\ncosmiccoffin.bandcamp.com",
                    "credits": "from Contact Compilation 2, track released October 25, 2011",
                    "license": "Attribution Non-commercial No Derivatives"
                },
