                    "trackCoverUrl_0": "https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a0920185036_0",
                    "art_id": 920185036,
                    "about": "There is nothing wrong with the beautiful world being corrupt and with sanctity defiled. It's just as natural as being born into this world. We seek perfection, but that only leads us to our ugly reflexive imperfections. This recording follows the very same concept. It's pure, growing; and in the end, it shows its true face as absolute filth, discomforting us for as long as we live.",
